          "text": "```python\ndef paginate(items: list[int], page: int, page_size: int) -> dict:\n    total = len(items)\n    total_pages = (total + page_size - 1) // page_size\n    start = (page - 1) * page_size\n    return {\n        \"items\": items[start:start + page_size],\n        \"page\": page,\n        \"page_size\": page_size,\n        \"total\": total,\n        \"total_pages\": total_pages,\n        \"has_next\": page < total_pages,\n    }\n```",
